Temperature Check

A system reads the temperature value.
If temperature is above 37°C, display “Fever detected”.
Otherwise, display “Normal”.

FUNCTION main()
    celcius=35
    result=temperaturecheck(celcius)
    DISPLAY result
    END FUNCTION

FUNCTION temperaturecheck(celcius)
    IF celcius < 0 THEN
    Return " invalid temperature"
    ELSE IF celcius > 37 THEN
    Return "Fever detected"
    ELSE
    Return "Normal"
    END IF
    END FUNCTION
    
